        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami yatuma kandi munene wundi wa kavaga na vasaza veve amusini. Yanigira ku kiguru naagwa mamumama ku maru geege imbiri wa Elija namugoonya, “O, mundu wa Nyasaye, omberere, inzi na avandu vange. Honyia livamwoyo lietu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanene vandi vaviri na vasaza va vaali navo viitwa nu muliru kutura mwigulu; navuzwa, mwaza yaanza ombere zimbavasi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
